{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/grpc/grpc-go/pulls/5274","id":889033112,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAacf8840_ZGY","html_url":"https://github.com/grpc/grpc-go/pull/5274","diff_url":"https://github.com/grpc/grpc-go/pull/5274.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/grpc/grpc-go/pull/5274.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/grpc/grpc-go/issues/5274","number":5274,"state":"closed","locked":true,"title":"grpc: move to `TransientFailure` in `pick_first` LB policy when all addresses are removed","user":{"login":"easwars","id":1638487,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2Mzg0ODc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1638487?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/easwars","html_url":"https://github.com/easwars","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/easwars/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/easwars/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/easwars/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/easwars/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/easwars/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/easwars/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/easwars/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/easwars/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/easwars/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"This behavior is in line with what other languages do and what we should have been doing all along.\r\n\r\nSummary of changes:\r\n- In the `pick_first` LB policy implementation, if a resolver address removes previously provided addresses, delete the existing subConn and move channel to `TransientFailure`. \r\n- Get rid of `TestEmptyAddrs`, which is no longer required because we have tests in `test/pickfirst_test.go` and `test/roundrobin_test.go` for this scenario. Also, `TestEmptyAddrs` was broken anyway.\r\n- Add a test in `test/pibkfirst_test.go` to exercise this functionality.\r\n\r\nRELEASE NOTES:\r\n- Change connectivity state to `TransientFailure` in `pick_first` LB policy when all addresses are removed","created_at":"2022-03-25T02:23:03Z","updated_at":"2022-09-26T02:04:33Z","closed_at":"2022-03-29T22:06:28Z","merged_at":"2022-03-29T22:06:28Z","merge_commit_sha":"b6873c006da794d53fbee52aa463e8c21e9fc958","assignees":[{"login":"menghanl","id":960845,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk2MDg0NQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/960845?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/menghanl","html_url":"https://github.com/menghanl","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/menghanl/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/menghanl/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/menghanl/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/menghanl/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/menghanl/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/menghanl/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/menghanl/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/menghanl/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/menghanl/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},{"login":"easwars","id":1638487,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2Mzg0ODc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1638487?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/easwars","html_url":"https://github.com/easwars","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/easwars/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/easwars/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/easwars/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/easwars/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/easwars/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/easwars/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/